00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:07.110
<b>Parallel World Division</b>

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:10.030
<b>Betrayal</b>

00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:11.950
Someone's eating my snack?!

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.370
<b>Making
Faces</b>

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:17.000
There may be more than one truth.

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:18.000
<b>The culprit is among us</b>

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:18.000
<b>The culprit is among us</b>

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.920
<b>And... yet another evil shadow!</b>

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.420
This is the truth

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.170
<b>The world cried</b>

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>A love story that makes the heart tremble</b>

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:24.170
