<b>Unpredictable</b>

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:24.920
<b>One battle after another</b>

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:26.790
I'm...

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:27.780
And I'm...

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:29.180
Even I'm...

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:30.560
Uh, I'm....

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:36.570
<i>I'm Standing on a Million Lives</i>, Season 2.

